; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 8.26(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">응모자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">국민 누구나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">개인 또는 팀으로 참여 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">응모방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">공모전 전용 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(www.</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">지진안전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.com)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">제출양식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">분 이내의 영상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(mp4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">형식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; ms